tch him for the rest of his life to make sure he doesn't kill anyone (which may be hard if he can erase himself from your mind and become unnoticeable), it sounds like you're going to have to balance the lives of the mentally ill against the deaths of the sick and wounded or depressed.<br /> <br /> However he's depicted in Dragon Age, it wouldn't take the most imaginative Storyteller to make him into a major threat.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 12-21-2014, 11:00 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}